{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Shadow Brutes (dangerous) are an ",["l","怪物","enemy"]," found in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," after activating the ",["l","矿井#Shrine of Challenge","Shrine of Challenge"]," or during the ",["l","任务#Danger In The Deep","Danger In The Deep"]," quest. 150 void spirits (any type) need to be killed for the ",["l","探险家公会#Monster Eradication Goals","Monster Eradication Goal"]," at the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"],"."]]]],["Behavior",2,[["p",["They behave identical to their weaker counterpart, the ",["l","暗影狂徒","Shadow Brute"],". They have no special attacks, but resist ",["l","重量","knockback"],"."]]]],["Strategy",2,[["p",["Attack them, backing away when they get close."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Introduced."]]]]]]]}